Multiple predictions enter an array. Similar predictions reinforce each other (constructive interference). Outliers dampen. What survives N rounds of coherence filtering is the standing wave — the stable, resonant answer. Modulated by the Agape coefficient (R): when R→1, coordination cost→0 and synergy compounds exponentially.
